[0.735763,"o","\u001b[?1049h\u001b[22;0;0t\u001b[1;30r\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4l\u001b[?7h\u001b[?1h\u001b=\u001b[39;49m\u001b[?25l\u001b[39;49m\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[H\u001b[2J\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33mSelect provider:\r\u001b[2d\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[0;2m  ↑↓ navigate  ENTER/SPACE select  ESC cancel\r\u001b[4d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[32m → (●) Nous Portal (Everything your agent needs, 300+ models with bundled tool use)\u001b[5;4H\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m(○) Fireworks AI (OpenAI-compatible direct model API)\u001b[6;4H(○) OpenRouter (Pay-per-use API aggregator)\u001b[7;4H(○) Mixture of Agents (named presets; aggregator acts after reference models)\u001b[8;4H(○) NovitaAI (Cloud: Model API, Agent Sandbox, GPU Cloud)\u001b[9;4H(○) LM Studio (Local desktop app with built-in model server)\u001b[10;4H(○) Anthropic (Claude models via API key or Claude Code)\u001b[11;4H(○) OpenAI ▸ (ChatGPT/Codex subscription or direct OpenAI API)\u001b[12;4H(○) Qwen ▸ (Qwen Cloud / DashScope, Coding Plan, Token Plan & Qwen CLI OAuth)\u001b[13;4H(○) xAI Grok ▸ (Direct API or SuperGrok / Premium+ OAuth)\u001b[14;4H(○) Xiaomi MiMo (MiMo-V2.5 and V2 models: pro, omni, flash)\u001b[15;4H(○) Tencent Hy ▸ (Hy4 / Hy3 via TokenHub & TokenPlan)\u001b[16;4H(○) NVIDIA NIM (Nemotron models via build.nvidia.com or local NIM)\u001b[17;4H(○) GitHub Copilot ▸ (GitHub token API or copilot --acp process)\u001b[18;4H(○) Hugging Face Inference Providers\u001b[19;4H(○) Google AI Studio (Native Gemini API)\u001b[20;4H(○) Google Vertex AI (Gemini via GCP; OAuth2 service account or ADC, GCP billing/quotas)\u001b[21;4H(○) DeepSeek (V3, R1, coder, direct API)\u001b[22;4H(○) Z.AI / GLM (Zhipu direct API)\u001b[23;4H(○) Kimi / Moonshot ▸ (Coding Plan, Moonshot global & China endpoints)\u001b[24;4H(○) StepFun Step Plan (Agent / coding models via Step Plan API)\u001b[25;4H(○) MiniMax ▸ (Global, OAuth Coding Plan & China endpoints)\u001b[26;4H(○) Ollama Cloud (Cloud-hosted open models, ollama.com)\u001b[27;4H(○) Arcee AI (Trinity models, direct API)\u001b[28;4H(○) GMI Cloud (Multi-model direct API)\u001b[29;4H(○) Kilo Code (Kilo Gateway API)"]
